[{"title":"大醉示洪七峰","author":"沈光文","text":"今日蠢休文，大不合时宜。\n只知作桀犬，降表竟莫为。\n蹈海苦不死，患难徒相随。\n信友本事亲，绝裾悔难追。\n家亦有薄田，弃之来受饥。\n何敢与人争，志气似难隳。\n天水有名臣，北海使节持。\n厥孙居此地，坚操更标奇。\n我欣与之交，廿六载于兹。\n兔园谁赋雪，平原会可期。\n欲学樊将军，卮酒安足辞。\n浮白笑难老，醉言自觉痴。\n问途已若此，且读谷风诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5148,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"看菊","author":"沈光文","text":"我昨咏邛须，相将造芳圃。\n南种悉珍奇，目所未经睹。\n何须问主人，携樽直入庑。\n主人笑出迎，看花有俦伍。\n因之同欢酌，脱略如太古。\n尔我与菊花，亦竟忘宾主。\n即此称快哉，主人有馀贾。\n相结再来期，兴酣慎莫拒。\n乘此花正开，聊以慰辛苦。\n诘朝敕庖人，折柬招众父。\n我亦与其中，晨兴便接武。\n入门闻清香，举目爱花妩。\n登筵饮醇醪，饱德铭肺腑。\n为乐欣正长，引商复刻羽。\n阳春天气佳，月丽清虚府。\n秉烛继夜游，分吟索韵谱。\n才推河间雄，笺飞白雪舞。\n诸公八斗高，自足当绣虎。\n我乃欲效颦，如弄输门斧。\n瞻言栖依处，何异金门坞。\n傲骨我终持，不与时仰俯。\n朗吟乞食诗，无以济终寠。\n饮酒不能多，所畏罚童羖。\n当此知己间，强为尽维醹。\n主人酬劝频，先醒嫌小户。\n月色满花枝，时将过夜午。\n运甓有后人，为能继乃祖。\n柴桑独酌后，犹恋晋亡土。\n迄今景高蹈，五字惭规抚。\n维菊与忘言，芬芳自倾吐。\n序晚值风霜，劲节孰予侮。\n藉非高士流，滥赏奚足取。\n共识此中意，斯会同友辅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5149,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曾则通久病以诗问之","author":"沈光文","text":"子固今能诗，恨其多病耳。\n岂疑圣人徒，乃踵吾家美。\n买药则无钱，受饥偏不死。\n挥毫但苦吟，应即霍然矣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5150,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"沈光文","text":"所恨饿而不死，人情无怪其然。\n久当困厄如鬼，日逐清虚若仙。\n谓尔乘车可羡，嗟余弹铗堪怜。\n从今只安时命，夫亦何敢怨天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5151,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥1659除夕","author":"沈光文","text":"年年送穷穷愈留，今年不送穷且羞。\n穷亦知羞穷自去，明朝恰与新年遇。\n赠我椒樽属故交，频频推解为同胞。\n客路相依十四载，明年此日知何在。\n修门遥遥路难通，古来击楫更谁同。\n也怜窭空嗟无告，犹欲坚持冰雪操。\n爆竹声喧似故乡，繁华满目总堪伤。\n起去看天天未晓，鸡声一唱残年了。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5152,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柬曾则通借米","author":"沈光文","text":"迩来乞食竟无处，饥即驱我亦不去。\n甑中生尘兴索然，飧风吸露望青天。\n穷途依人仍不足，自顾已忘荣与辱。\n何当稚子困饿啼，绝不欲我作夷齐。\n勉学鲁公书新帖，呼庚未免为臣妾。\n嗟，嗟，苦节尤难在后头，一日不死中心忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5153,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贷米于人无应者","author":"沈光文","text":"同是穷途同作客，饱得烟霞煮得石。\n但使清虚腹里存，诗瘦偏多新意格。\n也知诗瘦恰随秋，高飞秋色入浯州。\n苍狗浮云倏变幻，老我狂愚我自羞。\n西山尚有中子在，周全应尽性天爱。\n乃竟二饿千载垂，旅处寡亲益增忾。\n我来避世如避秦，上下无交馈赠屯。\n倘能屈曲为小贬，何妨白日竟骄人。\n骄人者流世所敬，不辨笑邪反笑正。\n大家势利正营营，谁向此中审究竟。\n昨夜梦中谁赠云，醒时拾得似纷纷。\n人间世事尚难料，如何天上获相分。\n感此高谊思所报，木瓜何以投永好。\n今日幼安固如何，却亦未曾除皂帽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5154,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野菊","author":"沈光文","text":"野性偏宜野，寒花独耐寒。\n经冬开未尽，不与俗人看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5155,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀乡","author":"沈光文","text":"万里程何远，萦回思不穷。\n安平江上水，汹涌海潮通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5156,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见博者","author":"沈光文","text":"好将孤注作机关，名士清谈未是閒。\n驿骑但能传捷报，出游何必不东山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5157,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸卯1633端午 其一","author":"沈光文","text":"年年此日有新诗，总属伤心羁旅时。\n却恨饿来还不死，欲添长命缕何为。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5158,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸卯1633端午 其二","author":"沈光文","text":"海天多雨湿端阳，闭户翛然一枕凉。\n不是好高偏绝俗，并州今且作商量。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5159,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸卯1633端午 其三","author":"沈光文","text":"笑予何事日栖迟，不读离骚便赋诗。\n几度寻筇欲问酒，蒲香隔院竟招谁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5160,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庭中白菊新开","author":"沈光文","text":"新妆入夜洗胭脂，移向灯前赏一卮。\n不觉更深花共醉，影随斜月舞迟迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5161,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏篱竹","author":"沈光文","text":"分植根株便发枝，炎方空作雪霜思。\n看他尽有参天势，只为孤贞尚寄篱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5162,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏题","author":"沈光文","text":"十五年来一故吾，衰颜无奈白髭须。\n只应遍处题诗句，莫问量江事有无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5163,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"释迦果","author":"沈光文","text":"称名颇似足誇人，不是中原大谷珍。\n端为上林栽未得，只应海岛作安身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5164,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番柑","author":"沈光文","text":"种出蛮方味作酸，熟来包灿小金丸。\n假如移向中原去，压雪庭前亦可看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5165,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"椰子","author":"沈光文","text":"壳内凝肪径寸浮，番人有法制为油。\n穷民买向灯檠用，祇为芝麻岁不收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5166,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赤坎城匾额图","author":"沈光文","text":"郑王忠勇义旗兴，水陆雄师震海瀛。\n炮垒巍峨横夕照，东溟夷丑寂无声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5167,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望月","author":"沈光文","text":"望月家千里，怀人水一湾。\n自当安蹇劣，常有好容颜。\n旅况不如意，衡门亦早关。\n每逢北来客，借问几时还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5168,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题","author":"沈光文","text":"吾亦爱吾耳，如何欲乞怜。\n叩阍翻有路，投刺竟无缘。\n道以孤高重，持当困苦坚。\n既来学避地，言色且从权。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5169,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜眠听雨","author":"沈光文","text":"遇晴常听月，无月听偏难。\n海怒声疑近，溪喧势作寒。\n閒枝惊鸟宿，野渚洽鱼欢。\n梦与诗争局，诗成梦亦残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5170,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题宁靖王斋壁","author":"沈光文","text":"修得一间屋，坐来身与閒。\n夜深常听月，门闭好留山。\n但得羁栖意，无嗟世路艰。\n天人应共仰，愧我学题蛮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5171,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊受风残又复无雨润累累发花虽不足观亦可聊我慰也","author":"沈光文","text":"天风吹不尽，憔悴复舒英。\n似有催诗意，还多望酒情。\n会当枯亦发，是乃困而亨。\n爱惜饶真赏，休将境遇评。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5172,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卢司马惠朱薯赋谢","author":"沈光文","text":"隔城遥望处，秋水正依依。\n煮石烟犹冷，乘桴人未归。\n调饥思饱德，同饿喜分薇。\n旧德萦怀抱，于兹更不违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5173,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其一","author":"沈光文","text":"未伸靖节志，居此积忧忡。\n退避依麋侣，流离傍蜃宫。\n身閒因性懒，我拙任人工。\n岛上风威厉，衾寒梦未终。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5174,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其二","author":"沈光文","text":"采薇思往事，千古仰高踪。\n放弃成吾逸，逢迎自昔慵。\n花枯邀雨润，山险倩云封。\n即此烟霞外，心清听晚钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5175,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其三","author":"沈光文","text":"不改栖迟趣，偏因诗酒降。\n晨风摇远树，夜月照寒缸。\n地静长留古，心幽岂逐尨。\n兴来怀友处，结韵老梅桩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5176,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其四","author":"沈光文","text":"蓬蒿老仲蔚，卜亦卖成都。\n独钓丝千尺，分耕云半区。\n乐饥水有泌，行乞市非吴。\n但是栖依者，相将莫问途。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5177,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其五","author":"沈光文","text":"朋来閒话旧，感叹到斜曛。\n联袂招新月，分途送暮云。\n梅寒摇梦影，笔冻冷花纹。\n兴倦登楼矣，依刘今未闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5178,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其六","author":"沈光文","text":"往事平生恨，株牵且俟河。\n触藩谁遣触，磨蝎命先磨。\n海屿薇原少，天南雁不过。\n支扉当夜静，霜月影婆娑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5179,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其七","author":"沈光文","text":"南来积岁月，又看荔将花。\n志欲希前辈，时方重北衙。\n隐心随倦羽，寒梦绕归槎。\n忽竟疑仙去，新尝蒙顶茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5180,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀 其八","author":"沈光文","text":"忽尔冬将半，居诸不肯停。\n新诗萦雪梦，愁思入寒扃。\n同调孚声气，时贤重典型。\n敝庐依大武，遥接数峰青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5181,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其一","author":"沈光文","text":"战攻人世界，隐我入山间。\n且作耽诗癖，谁云运甓閒。\n松杉生远影，风雨隔前湾。\n天路遥看近，归云共鹤还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5182,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其二","author":"沈光文","text":"生平未了志，每每托逃禅。\n不遂清时适，聊耽野趣偏。\n远钟留夜月，寒雨静江天。\n拯涣方乘木，才弘利涉川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5183,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其三","author":"沈光文","text":"念此朝宗义，孤衷每郁寥。\n未能支厦屋，祇可托渔樵。\n冀作云中鹤，来听海上潮。\n长安难得去，不是为途遥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5184,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其四","author":"沈光文","text":"已当天末处，地亦近南交。\n欲雨虚帷润，无家壮志抛。\n桐看几落叶，燕记屡营巢。\n正作还乡梦，虚窗竹乱敲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5185,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其六","author":"沈光文","text":"云间长抱石，鸥梦浅依沙。\n山静能容客，潮流直到家。\n苟全徙倚便，小隐困穷加。\n不识春风面，何人问落花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5186,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其七","author":"沈光文","text":"饿已千秋久，人堪饭首阳。\n苦忧徒反侧，无事笑徜徉。\n慨想风云合，回思雨露长。\n只今空寂寞，能不恋沧浪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5187,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山间 其八","author":"沈光文","text":"长松不可俯，远视立亭亭。\n月色来窗曙，山光到海青。\n荒村馀古意，老鹤爱修翎。\n正发临池兴，忧来笔又停。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5188,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重九大风","author":"沈光文","text":"有处可寻菊，还当冒雨行。\n久因诗兴懒，徒觉海潮鸣。\n人以悲秋老，身当避地轻。\n不堪佳节度，休著孟嘉名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5189,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番妇","author":"沈光文","text":"社里朝朝出，同群担负行。\n野花头插满，黑齿草涂成。\n赛胜缠红锦，新妆挂白珩。\n鹿脂搽抹惯，欲与麝兰争。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5190,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠友人归武林","author":"沈光文","text":"却有机缘在，相逢意气同。\n来看云起处，共话月明中。\n去去程何远，悠悠思不穷。\n钱塘江上水，直与海潮通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5191,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归望","author":"沈光文","text":"归望频年阻，徒欢梦舞斑。\n在原嗟鸟散，杖策效鳞攀。\n镜里头多白，风前泪积殷。\n用坚饥馁志，壮士久无颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5192,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"齐价人移浯以诗投赠次韵答之","author":"沈光文","text":"性懒恒耽逸，身閒若避纷。\n当关学望气，载酒欲论文。\n佳翰诚臻圣，新诗更轶群。\n枝栖欣不远，时冀挹高云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5193,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"齐价人旋禾未及言别兹承柬寄欣和","author":"沈光文","text":"忽带青云去，惟将逸韵留。\n剡舟知待雪，陶径已辞秋。\n风足高山水，光原灿斗牛。\n瑶华承寄问，多病获新瘳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5194,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谢王愧两司马见赠","author":"沈光文","text":"廿载仰鸿名，南来幸识荆。\n忘机同海客，尊义缔寒盟。\n霖雨时需切，东山望不轻。\n流离谁似我，周急藉先生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5195,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"葛衣吟","author":"沈光文","text":"岁月复相从，中原起战烽。\n难违昔日志，未泯一时踪。\n故国山河远，他乡幽恨重。\n葛衣宁敢弃，有逊鲁家佣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5196,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄迹效人吟 其一","author":"沈光文","text":"不道十馀载，犹然若故时。\n因人作事缓，连我信天疑。\n燕雁春秋易，沧桑日月迟。\n为兴靡骋感，且滞水之湄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5197,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄迹效人吟 其二","author":"沈光文","text":"分得青天在，盘桓且振裾。\n行春依雨歇，问月借春舒。\n草咎张椎误，兼之荆剑疏。\n将传岛上史，末路漫踌躇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5198,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄迹效人吟 其三","author":"沈光文","text":"共说暂来尔，淹留可奈何。\n驱羊劳叱石，返舍拟挥戈。\n我耻周旋倦，人言厌恶多。\n旅途宜自惜，慨以当长歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5199,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄迹效人吟 其四","author":"沈光文","text":"望水知遥途，隔江风景殊。\n艰难依鹭渚，愤发奋虬须。\n仙近饥留朔，山移子继愚。\n閒鸥不厌我，日共与为徒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5200,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄迹效人吟 其五","author":"沈光文","text":"于我应当饿，家人苦未能。\n凭胸携旧积，就史接多朋。\n致牍童傒厌，分粮雁鹜憎。\n谋身尚不足，王业几时兴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5201,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄迹效人吟 其六","author":"沈光文","text":"烟霞岛上满，落日鬼豪侵。\n支命全亏骨，包愁总在心。\n径荒陶兴浅，袍吝范寒深。\n起舞徒虚事，频年听翰音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5202,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答曾则通次来韵","author":"沈光文","text":"海天滞迹久，世受国恩同。\n事业饥寒后，身名忍辱中。\n困当坚骨力，閒足老英雄。\n握手相怜处，何须怨谷风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5203,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日和陈文生韵","author":"沈光文","text":"秋声方动处，怪是客偏闻。\n东国书难去，西山饿早分。\n知还同倦鸟，不碍等閒云。\n惭愧故人意，传言战血殷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5204,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀庄桤庵","author":"沈光文","text":"别岛山川异，伤怀是故臣。\n同心为千载，分手记初春。\n志士尊声气，东都重缙绅。\n寒梅将欲放，折寄不嫌频。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5205,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"言忧","author":"沈光文","text":"明识忧无用，忘忧实不能。\n安危思覆卵，进退履春冰。\n怀杞终何益，支天未可凭。\n东山谁稳卧，怀想古凝丞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5206,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓发目加湾即事","author":"沈光文","text":"浓雾不为雨，乘朝向北行。\n此中有长恨，回首意难平。\n冀作南山豹，新闻出谷莺。\n忽然开霁处，前路甚分明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5207,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"发新港途中即事","author":"沈光文","text":"隐心甘作苦，逐逐却难禁。\n计拙忧成老，身閒喜独吟。\n尘嚣浑欲脱，山水试相寻。\n满路芙蓉发，秋光已觉深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5208,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与友奕","author":"沈光文","text":"吟罢客方至，疏枰手自开。\n不堪观败局，聊欲试燃灰。\n野竹声初静，遥风翠亦来。\n谁兴淝水业，且复共衔杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5209,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隩草戊戌1654仲冬和韵 其一","author":"沈光文","text":"宁不怀乡国，并州说暂居。\n无枝空绕树，弹铗又歌鱼。\n炼骨危疑集，盈头珍惜梳。\n感追无限际，悔绝昔年裾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5210,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隩草戊戌1654仲冬和韵 其二","author":"沈光文","text":"随时却不闷，而闷实难排。\n浪撼江空雨，风翻天半霾。\n热肠知未冷，晚节慎无乖。\n荣辱渔家少，乘潮又泛箄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5211,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隩草戊戌1654仲冬和韵 其三","author":"沈光文","text":"义旗嗟越绝，剩得此顽民。\n矫矫心如石，丝丝鬓欲银。\n中山几度醒，故国十三春。\n尚慎虚瞻陟，天寒夜泣旻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5212,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隩草戊戌1654仲冬和韵 其四","author":"沈光文","text":"得兴灵武业，谁作李长源。\n天宝人凭说，渔阳鼓尚喧。\n居辽当日管，卧雪此时袁。\n仆更痴于我，安然懒出门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5213,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隩草戊戌1654仲冬和韵 其五","author":"沈光文","text":"一自椎秦后，同人在海山。\n冠裳不可毁，节义敢轻删。\n受冻频坚骨，撄霜茂长颜。\n南阳高卧稳，罔识世途艰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5214,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]